        "en": "Clients frequently report successful medical treatments for routine health checkups, growth removal surgeries, and specialized acupuncture for chronic pain in dogs. Many owners praise the thorough clinical care. However, several dissatisfied reviewers felt diagnosis decisions were rushed or unhelpful for acute pet illnesses, creating a mixed picture of clinical outcomes."
