        "en": "Compassionate team with varied experiences"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The majority of reviewers praise the veterinarians and veterinary assistants, highlighting Dr. Legaspi and Dr. Pacifici for their warmth, patience, and gentle approach with pets. In contrast, several clients expressed frustration over brief doctor face-time during visits or felt customer service was indifferent during stressful appointments."
      }
    },
