      },
      "text": {
        "en": "While some clients found veterinarians informative and straightforward when explaining medical plans, communication is a frequent point of criticism. Several pet owners reported difficulties obtaining clear answers to follow-up treatment questions, feeling dismissed over the phone, or not receiving sufficient transparency during consultations."
      }
    }
